{
  "id": "E169",
  "title": "I Am Suffering From Insomnia",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-11-11",
  "synopsis": "How do you deal with having trouble sleeping?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/573/407ecd4fb19760e7b87cd2f5214a15d0ff44e627.mp3?1509987758",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我失眠了 \n\n圆圆：你怎么了？看起来，脸色不太好。\n方方：我最近一直失眠。\n圆圆：失眠？怎么回事？\n方方：没什么，我就是一到夜里就会清醒起来。\n圆圆：我前一段时间也有这个问题。\n方方：那你是怎么调整的呢？\n圆圆：我白天下班后去做运动，晚上睡眠就好了很多。\n方方：看来，我也要去健身房运动运动了。\n圆圆：是啊，要不我们下次一起去吧？\n方方：好啊，那我们下班后一起去吧！",
    "traditional": "我失眠了 \n\n圓圓：你怎麼了？看起來，臉色不太好。\n方方：我最近一直失眠。\n圓圓：失眠？怎麼回事？\n方方：沒什麼，我就是一到夜裡就會清醒起來。\n圓圓：我前一段時間也有這個問題。\n方方：那你是怎麼調整的呢？\n圓圓：我白天下班後去做運動，晚上睡眠就好了很多。\n方方：看來，我也要去健身房運動運動了。\n圓圓：是啊，要不我們下次一起去吧？\n方方：好啊，那我們下班後一起去吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Am Suffering From Insomnia"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "圆圆：你怎么了？看起来，脸色不太好。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：你怎麼了？看起來，臉色不太好。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán nǐ zěn me le kàn qǐ lái liǎn sè bú tài hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Are you ok? You don’t look so well."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "方方：我最近一直失眠。",
      "traditional": "方方：我最近一直失眠。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng wǒ zuì jìn yì zhí shī mián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: I am suffering from insomnia recently."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "圆圆：失眠？怎么回事？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：失眠？怎麼回事？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shī mián zěn me huí shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Suffering from insomnia? How did this happen?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "方方：没什么，我就是一到夜里就会清醒起来。",
      "traditional": "方方：沒什麼，我就是一到夜裡就會清醒起來。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng méi shén me wǒ jiù shì yí dào yè lǐ jiù huì qīng xǐng qǐ lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: It's nothing, I just always wake up in the middle of the night."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "圆圆：我前一段时间也有这个问题。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：我前一段時間也有這個問題。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán wǒ qián yí duàn shí jiān yě yǒu zhè ge wèn tí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: I had the same problem a while back."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "方方：那你是怎么调整的呢？",
      "traditional": "方方：那你是怎麼調整的呢？",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng nà nǐ shì zěn me tiáo zhěng de ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: So how did you get better?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "圆圆：我白天下班后去做运动，晚上睡眠就好了很多。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：我白天下班後去做運動，晚上睡眠就好了很多。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán wǒ bái tiān xià bān hòu qù zuò yùn dòng wǎn shang shuì mián jiù hǎo le hěn duō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: I started exercising after work and slept much better."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "方方：看来，我也要去健身房运动运动了。",
      "traditional": "方方：看來，我也要去健身房運動運動了。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng kàn lái wǒ yě yào qù jiàn shēn fáng yùn dòng yùn dòng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: It seems like I also need go to the gym and do some exercise."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "圆圆：是啊，要不我们下次一起去吧？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：是啊，要不我們下次一起去吧？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shì a yào bù wǒ men xià cì yì qǐ qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Indeed. Why don’t we go to the gym together next time?"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "方方：好啊，那我们下班后一起去吧！",
      "traditional": "方方：好啊，那我們下班後一起去吧！",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng hǎo a nà wǒ men xià bān hòu yì qǐ qù ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: Ok. Let’s go there together after work."
    }
  ],
